{"verse_key": "10:34", "surah": 10, "verse": 34, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ هَلْ مِن شُرَكَآئِكُم مَّن يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ ۖ فَأَنَّىٰ تُؤْفَكُونَ", "translation": "Say, \"Are there of your 'partners' any who begins creation and then repeats it?\" Say, \"Allāh begins creation and then repeats it, so how are you deluded?\"", "verse_from_ms": 863560, "verse_to_ms": 883910, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 863560, "end_ms": 864120}, {"i": 1, "text": "هَلْ", "start_ms": 864120, "end_ms": 865170}, {"i": 2, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 865170, "end_ms": 865540}, {"i": 3, "text": "شُرَكَآئِكُم", "start_ms": 865540, "end_ms": 868440}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَّن", "start_ms": 868440, "end_ms": 869260}, {"i": 5, "text": "يَبْدَؤُا۟", "start_ms": 869260, "end_ms": 870580}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْخَلْقَ", "start_ms": 870580, "end_ms": 871420}, {"i": 7, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 871420, "end_ms": 872540}, {"i": 8, "text": "يُعِيدُهُۥ", "start_ms": 872540, "end_ms": 874480}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 874480, "end_ms": 875030}, {"i": 10, "text": "قُلِ", "start_ms": 875030, "end_ms": 875590}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 875590, "end_ms": 876280}, {"i": 12, "text": "يَبْدَؤُا۟", "start_ms": 876280, "end_ms": 877130}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱلْخَلْقَ", "start_ms": 877130, "end_ms": 878110}, {"i": 14, "text": "ثُمَّ", "start_ms": 878110, "end_ms": 879260}, {"i": 15, "text": "يُعِيدُهُۥ", "start_ms": 879260, "end_ms": 880760}, {"i": 16, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 880760, "end_ms": 883515}, {"i": 17, "text": "فَأَنَّىٰ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "تُؤْفَكُونَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}